---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  exactTitle={true}
  title="Bulk Custom T-Shirt Event Needs | LiAlvaro T-Shirt Printing"
  description="What to look for when choosing a print partner for bulk custom t-shirt event orders in Los Angeles."
>
  <article class="page-shell post">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Event planning · 8 min read</p>
      <h1>The Ultimate Guide to Finding the Perfect Place for Your Bulk Custom T-Shirt Event Needs</h1>
      <p>
        Organizing a large event? Here’s what to look for when choosing a print partner for bulk orders so everything
        arrives on time.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Planning an event is stressful enough without worrying whether volunteer shirts or merch will look right — or
        arrive on time. For corporate retreats, races, and festivals, bulk apparel is part of the professional image.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Prioritize communication</h2>
      <p>
        For hundreds or thousands of garments, you need a partner who will review artwork, suggest garments, and flag
        print issues early — not only a file-upload portal.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Use the right method at scale</h2>
      <p>
        DTG is excellent for small batches. Larger runs often favor screen printing for speed and unit cost. We’ll help
        you match method to quantity and design.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Ask about capacity and deadlines</h2>
      <p>
        State your drop-dead date before you approve a quote. Clear timing beats surprises — especially for event day.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Request a proof</h2>
      <p>
        Ask for a digital mock-up, or a physical sample when timing allows. Seeing color on the actual fabric saves costly
        rework.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Delivery logistics</h2>
      <p>
        If your event is in Los Angeles, a local partner can simplify logistics. Ask about local delivery options for
        your order size and venue.
      </p>

      <div class="cta">
        <h2>Planning an event in LA?</h2>
        <p>Request a bulk order quote — no obligation.</p>
        <button type="button" data-quote-trigger>Get a bulk order quote</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 42rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
  }

  .prose p {
    margin: 0;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 85%, var(--mesh-grey));
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .cta h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .cta button {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.15rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--print-red);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--print-red);
    color: var(--white);
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
</style>
